  "uncertainty_notes": "1. live_site_dns_fail: purepeptidelabs.com and www.purepeptidelabs.com both returned DNS NXDOMAIN on 2026-05-07. All data sourced from Wayback Machine snapshots (Jan 2025 and Aug-Sep 2025). Site may be offline or domain may have lapsed. Trustpilot snapshot from Feb 2026 still shows active reviews suggesting the brand was operating at least through early 2026. 2. lab_partner_named: COA index page at /pages/certificate-of-analysis lists individual COA sub-pages for each product on purepeptidelabs.com/pages/* subdomain, but the sub-pages themselves returned 404 from Wayback, so the specific lab partner cannot be confirmed. About-page states 'HPLC and Mass Spectrometry' testing. 3. dose_values_for_non-fetched-products: For products not individually fetched (BPC-157, TB-500, Ipamorelin, PT-141, Selank, Semax, Melanotan 2, MOTS-C, DSIP, Epithalon, Sermorelin, CJC products, Melanotan 1, NAD+, GHRP-6, SNAP-8, GLOW, Kisspeptin, Hexarelin, 5-Amino-1Q), dose values estimated from comparable vendors and the product naming convention (e.g., homepage Jan 2025 shows 'BPC-157 5mg or 10mg'). Per_mg prices are therefore [INFERENCE] for these products and marked accordingly. 4. age_gate: No age-gate popup observed in any fetched page. The TOS (line 63) includes a buyer acknowledgment of 18+ age but there is no dedicated age gate mechanism visible. 5. year_established: Site copyright says 2025, About page says library study room founding; Wayback first indexed Jan 2025 (snapshot 20250125075237). Estimated 2024 based on Shopify shop creation context. 6. ship_to_scope: No explicit international shipping policy found; shipping policy focuses on US domestic; classified as us_only. 7. content_footprint.blog: No /blogs path found in CDX index; no blog link in navigation. 8. checkout_flow.fields_collected: Cart/checkout walk limited to empty cart page via Wayback; fields from FAQ description of Square Invoicing flow (email receipt + credit/debit card). Full checkout field set not observable. 9. volume_tier_label: Only one explicit volume discount found: 'Buy 10 of the Same (mg) - Get 20% Off' on product pages (GLP-1SEMA, Cagrilintide). Applied to all fetched product pages. 10. IGF-1LR3 and 5-Amino-1Q sale price oddity: catalog shows sale price ($59.95) higher than crossed-out regular price ($55.95) -- unusual pricing; values captured exactly as displayed."
}
